@startuml UC-01: Đăng nhập hệ thống

actor "User" as User
participant "Frontend" as FE
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "User Service" as US
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
database "Redis" as Redis

User -> FE: Nhập email, password
FE -> GW: POST /api/auth/login
GW -> US: Forward request
US -> DB: employeeLogin(email)
DB --> US: Employee data + permissions
US -> US: bcrypt.compare(password)
US -> US: Check permissions\n(FULL/EDIT/VIEW)
US -> Redis: Store permissions\n(employeeId + permissions)
US -> US: Generate JWT tokens
US -> DB: Store refresh token
US --> GW: { token, refreshToken, permissions }
GW --> FE: Login response
FE --> User: Redirect to dashboard\nbased on permissions

@enduml
